WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The Ragnarok punches through a wall of energy, blue shield flaring around its hull.

2
00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
Esthar's automated turrets open fire as explosions engulf the city streets.

3
00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Monsters rain down amid fireballs. Hexagonal shields flicker across the skyline.

4
00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
The Ragnarok crashes down among the rubble, dragon claws gripping shattered stone.
